{"349260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BlastZone 2", "steam_appid": 349260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [822060, 822061], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlastZone 2 is a fast, explosive 2.5D shooter built entirely solo on a custom engine and supported with continuous updates for over a decade.</strong> <strong>It includes </strong><strong><i>two full games</i></strong><strong>, the complete original BlastZone 1 (classic + enhanced versions) and the expanded sequel BlastZone 2, offering a massive amount of content across 7 game modes, online and local co‑op, and dozens of ship/loadout combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/6e84b205aaf4e58c51d6f6811064ff80.poster.avif?t=1783018296\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/6e84b205aaf4e58c51d6f6811064ff80.webm?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/6e84b205aaf4e58c51d6f6811064ff80.mp4?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Games Included — BlastZone 1 + BlastZone 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the original BlastZone 1 in both its authentic TI‑85‑style form and a fully enhanced “Classic” remake. Then jump into BlastZone 2, a modern 2.5D shooter with cinematic missions, survival modes, and high‑speed arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/7485967ca26b65e1127468689d9e0387.poster.avif?t=1783018296\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/7485967ca26b65e1127468689d9e0387.webm?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/7485967ca26b65e1127468689d9e0387.mp4?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast‑Paced 2.5D Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through enemy barricades at high speed, unleash hyper mode, fire devastating omega cannons, and master seven unique ships — each with distinct strengths, weaknesses, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in <strong>local or online co‑op</strong>, combining ship roles for advanced strategies like defender‑and‑gunner pairings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/5ef3f5f57ee5f7b3e9fcc7de1f25f817.poster.avif?t=1783018296\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/5ef3f5f57ee5f7b3e9fcc7de1f25f817.webm?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/5ef3f5f57ee5f7b3e9fcc7de1f25f817.mp4?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innovative Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D controls with hazards and enemies moving in full 3D space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique 2nd‑person shooter sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic mission encounters with large‑scale bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbo variants for every mode for high‑intensity challenge runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All 7 Game Modes Included</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BlastZone 1 Original</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A faithful recreation of the TI‑85 classic to catch up on the series</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 35–40 minute cinematic campaign with handcrafted enemy formations, big bosses, and unique 3D gameplay sequences, including a 2nd‑person shooter area.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission+ Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A higher‑intensity remix of Mission Mode with all weapons unlocked from the start and significantly more enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic A Mode (BlastZone 1 Remastered)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enhanced “defend the base” arcade mode with beam weapons, a chain‑based scoring system, and modern effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic B Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A risk‑reward scoring mode where every action adds or subtracts from a shared points pool. Stop the run at the right moment to maximize your score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinitely generated levels with a multiplier system based on precision skill shots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blitz Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high‑density survival variant with massive enemy swarms and a fully powered ship from the start. Maintaining hyper power is the key to survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/163f1558617aa06eb5ce27b53facfa07.poster.avif?t=1783018296\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/163f1558617aa06eb5ce27b53facfa07.webm?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/163f1558617aa06eb5ce27b53facfa07.mp4?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online and local co‑op</strong> for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 playable ships</strong>, each with unique loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 weapon types</strong>, including beams, force fields, cluster grenades, and machine guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of enemy types</strong> with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 large environments</strong> including mountains, caves, and outer space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty levels</strong> for newcomers and genre veterans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online world leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turbo mode variants</strong> for every game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing free updates</strong> for over a decade</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/250e436638c5e1f9ab5f2e197cdf258a.poster.avif?t=1783018296\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/250e436638c5e1f9ab5f2e197cdf258a.webm?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/250e436638c5e1f9ab5f2e197cdf258a.mp4?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controller Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BlastZone 2 supports a wide range of DirectInput and XInput gamepads, including Xbox 360 controllers. If you’re unsure about compatibility, try the free demo.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlastZone 2 is a fast, explosive 2.5D shooter built entirely solo on a custom engine and supported with continuous updates for over a decade.</strong> <strong>It includes </strong><strong><i>two full games</i></strong><strong>, the complete original BlastZone 1 (classic + enhanced versions) and the expanded sequel BlastZone 2, offering a massive amount of content across 7 game modes, online and local co‑op, and dozens of ship/loadout combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/6e84b205aaf4e58c51d6f6811064ff80.poster.avif?t=1783018296\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/6e84b205aaf4e58c51d6f6811064ff80.webm?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/6e84b205aaf4e58c51d6f6811064ff80.mp4?t=1783018296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Games Included — BlastZone 1 + BlastZone 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the original BlastZone 1 in both its authentic TI‑85‑style form and a fully enhanced “Classic” remake. Then jump into BlastZone 2, a modern 2.5D shooter with cinematic missions, survival modes, and high‑speed arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349260/extras/7485967ca26b65e112